Z||000000||DreXteR||07-03-2001||01:32 AM||||Can I use this cam in my 2.8??<BR> <A HREF="http://www.compcams.com/base/processes/camdetails.asp?Known=16-247-4&submit.x=87&submit.y=9" TARGET=_blank>http://www.compcams.com/base/processes/camdetails.asp?Known=16-247-4&submit.x=87&submit.y=9</A> <P><BR>Thanx<P><BR>DreX||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steven||07-03-2001||09:40 AM||||Don't want to mislead you, by saying "yes it will" or "no it won't". So I will tell you what I used. Go here, <A HREF="http://www.cranecams.com/master/apps/chevy1.htm#2." TARGET=_blank>http://www.cranecams.com/master/apps/chevy1.htm#2.</A>  CompuCam , I used #2 the 2030. Spec card for my cam is here: <A HREF="http://dab7.cranecams.com/SpecCard/DisplayCatalogCard.asp?PN=254122&B1=Display+Card" TARGET=_blank>http://dab7.cranecams.com/SpecCard/DisplayCatalogCard.asp?PN=254122&B1=Display+Card</A> <BR>Hope this helps some.<P>------------------<BR>85 Fiero GT<BR>3.2 liter w/4sp manual trans<BR>Silver.||||reg||1
